| `Pickupable` | "Pickupable" | Right Column Flags |
| `Hangable` | "Hangable" | Right Column Flags |
| `IsHorizontal` | "Hook East" | Right Column Flags |
| `IsVertical` | "Hook South" | Right Column Flags |
| `Rotatable` | "Rotatable" | Right Column Flags |
